---
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<section>
    <p>
        I'm a passionate developer with a passion for creating user-facing
        software. I thrive on challenges and enjoy learning new things. In 2025
        I learned Python to facilitate my work with <a
            class="text-blue-500 hover:underline cursor-pointer"
            href="https://www.medieteknik.com"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer noopener">@medieteknik</a
        >, and started my journey with Rust with my <a
            class="text-blue-500 hover:underline cursor-pointer"
            href="https://github.com/andre-eriksson/browser"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer noopener">Rust 🦀 Browser</a
        >
        <span class="text-neutral-600 select-none"
            >(created with minimal dependencies)</span
        > project.
    </p>
    <br />
    <p>
        In 2026 I will continue the development of my browser project, and
        continue to contribute to open source projects which I've already
        contributed to <a
            class="text-blue-500 hover:underline cursor-pointer"
            href="https://zed.dev/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer noopener">@zed</a
        >
        <span class="text-neutral-600 select-none">(my IDE of choice)</span>.
        Let's see what this year has in store!
    </p>
</section>
